<span>9 de octubre de 2026</span><h3 class="title"><a href="https://sevillagolf.com/ii-jornada-taurina-2026-el-torero-manuel-escribano-comparte-en-el-real-club-sevilla-golf-experiencias-y-reflexiones-de-sus-20-anos-de-trayectoria-profesional/"> II Jornada Taurina 2026: El torero Manuel Escribano comparte en el Real Club Sevilla Golf experiencias y reflexiones de sus 20 años de trayectoria profesional</a></h3></div><div class="excerpt">El Real Club Sevilla Golf acogió el jueves, 8 de octubre, la II Jornada Taurina&hellip;</div></div></div><div class="post-meta">
<span class="meta-author"> <a href="https://sevillagolf.com/author/teresa-beca/"> <i class="icon-default-style icon-salient-m-user"></i> Teresa Beca</a> </span><div class="nectar-love-wrap">
<a href="#" class="nectar-love" id="nectar-love-253707" title="Love this"> <i class="icon-salient-heart-2"></i><span class="love-text">Love</span><span class="total_loves"><span class="nectar-love-count">0</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="fws_6add91b5c6a79"  data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark"  class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-content vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top  top_margin_20px"  style="padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; "><div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-animation-delay="" data-bg-overlay="false"><div class="inner-wrap row-bg-layer" ><div class="row-bg viewport-desktop"  style=""></div></div></div><div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark center"><div  class="vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone flex_gap_desktop_10px"  data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" ><div class="vc_column-inner" ><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_slider span_12 col" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Testimonials" data-color="accent-color-dark" data-rating-color="accent-color" data-controls="default" data-add-border="" data-autorotate="5000" data-style="multiple_visible" ><div class="slides"><div class="flickity-viewport"><div class="flickity-slider"><blockquote><div data-shadow="" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/logo_google-293x300.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Sin duda, uno de los mejores campos de España. Se cuida hasta el mínimo detalle. Toda una experiencia de bienestar, elegancia y calidad. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name"></span><span class="title">Google Reviews</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/logo_google-293x300.png);">&#8220;</div><p>El campo es un "campazo", muy bien cuidado y con magníficos servicios, además del campo y el restaurante y la terraza, tiene la posibilidad de dejar a los niños con una cuidadora, y un menú infantil para que los padres puedan estar tranquilos jugando sabiendo que sus hijos están bien atendidos <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">Mercedes L.R</span><span class="title">Google Reviews</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/logo_google-293x300.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Campo de golf espectacular, muy bonito de jugar, muy cuidado y cómodo, sin grandes desniveles. Instalaciones muy cuidadas y personal del club muy atentos y agradables. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name"></span><span class="title">Google Reviews</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/logo_google-293x300.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Espectacular. Tiene el mejor diseño de campo de golf de España, un personal de 10, zona de prácticas de 10, club social de 10, el resto de las instalaciones deportivas son también de 10. En definitiva, si eres de Sevilla, juegas al golf o buscas un club para estar con la familia y no eres socio todavía, no sé qué estás haciendo. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">Nono Parrilla</span><span class="title">Google Reviews</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/logo_google-293x300.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Buen ambiente, instalaciones cuidadísimas y exquisito trato <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name"></span><span class="title">Google Reviews</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/logo_testimonial.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Platen Spanish senior championships. Course was in prestine condition. Greens super fast but true. Veel Well maintained. Course is located at just 10 minutes away from the city centre. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">martim.ricciardi</span><span class="title">Leading courses</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/logo_testimonial.png);">&#8220;</div><p>It’s always a pleasure to play here, the conditions of the course are incredible. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">cbrooker57</span><span class="title">Leading courses</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/logo_testimonial.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Real Club Seville is surely one of the best maintained club that we have ever seen. The grass on the garden in front of the car park looks like a green! Imagine the rest… Everyone in the shop and in the clubhouse bar was super nice. We will be back surely. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">JuanGomez</span><span class="title">Leading courses</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/logo_testimonial.png);">&#8220;</div><p>My favorite golf course in this Region. our Group loves to come back here because the maintainance is always incredible. Greens are fast and Fairways impecable. Club House with nice service and good food. we are coming back next year again. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">Patrice</span><span class="title">Leading courses</span></blockquote><blockquote><div data-shadow="true" class="image-icon has-bg" style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/logo_testimonial.png);">&#8220;</div><p>Played with a member, which certainly helped the course was in excellent condition, the greens were slick and fast. The staff were all pleasant and attentive. Throughly enjoyed my day at the club. Will definitely play there again. <span role="none" class="bottom-arrow"></span></p><span class="testimonial-name">RiSiBi</span><span class="title">Leading courses</span></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="fws_6add91b5c941c"  data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark"  class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section"  style="padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 80px; "><div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-animation-delay="" data-bg-overlay="false"><div class="inner-wrap row-bg-layer using-image" ><div class="row-bg viewport-desktop using-image"  style="background-image: url(https://sevillagolf.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/home-footer-JPG.jpg); background-position: left top; background-repeat: no-repeat; "></div></div></div><div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left"><div  class="vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone flex_gap_desktop_10px"  data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" ><div class="vc_column-inner" ><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div  class="vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone flex_gap_desktop_10px"  data-padding-pos="all" 